    "what_en": "Adds captions to an existing single-subject talking-head video without altering the footage. Default mode runs a verbatim lower-third rail and embeds only peak words behind the subject; pure-embed and themed styles also exist.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when you ask to caption a single-subject talking-head video, mention VFX/特效/酷炫字幕, or name a style from the 35-entry catalog. It probes the clip first and refuses multi-shot or speechless footage.",
    "say_en": [
